### Registro — versões devem coincidir com TERMS_VERSION e PRIVACY_POLICY_VERSION do servidor
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "A-strong-password-123",
  "companyName": "Empresa Demo",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "acceptedPrivacy": true,
  "termsVersion": "2026-10-01",
  "privacyVersion": "2026-10-01"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "A-strong-password-123"
}

### Rota protegida — substituir TOKEN pelo accessToken retornado no login
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Rota restrita a OWNER/ADMIN — substituir TOKEN
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/admin-check
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
